<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo adds 500 mln marks to 4-year bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo adds 500 mln marks to 4-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint leads BHF Bank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK HANNOVER</p>
<p> AMT **1.5 BLN DEM    COUPON     3.75	MATURITY    24.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  *	   PAY DATE    24.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.225     LISTING    HANN	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.6	 SELL CONC  0.165     DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> NOTES    **ORIGINAL 1.0 BLN MARK DEAL LAUNCHED 17.JAN</p>
<p>	     *NEW TRANCHE TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 706</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
